{
  "name": "Twin Arm Style",
  "type": "skill",
  "system": {
    "description": "<p>This skill only produces an effect when you have two [One-Handed] melee weapons equipped. You gain the [Dual Wield] condition, and your [Attack Power] becomes [Both Weapons' (Attack Power) combined].</p>\n<p>(SR2): Increase your [Attack Power] by +3.<br>(SR3): The bonus to [Attack Power] changes to +6.</p>\n<hr>\n<p><span class=\"Y2IQFc\" lang=\"en\">A fighting style that emphasizes the number of moves and attack power, wielding two weapons with both arms at the same time.</span></p>",
